   "kind": "plain",
   "title": "URINARY SYMPTOMS: who is it?",
   "lines": [
    "burning on voiding ± frequency, urgency",
    "LONG-TERM CARE resident: ALWAYS culture + sensitivities (often resistant to trimethoprim-sulfamethoxazole (TMP-SMX), amoxicillin-clavulanate)"
   ]
  },
